She tried to assassinate Gerald Ford.
她曾试图刺杀杰拉尔德·福特。

1502
01:00:38.740 --> 01:00:38.900
Right.
没错。

1503
01:00:38.900 --> 01:00:39.460
President Ford.
福特总统。

1504
01:00:39.700 --> 01:00:39.880
Right.
没错。

1505
01:00:40.360 --> 01:00:45.240
She was not part of the Tate-LaBianca murders, but she did try to assassinate Gerald Ford.
她虽然没有参与泰特-拉比安卡谋杀案，但确实试图刺杀过杰拉尔德·福特。

1506
01:00:45.580 --> 01:00:47.740
So I guess Creed kissed her.
所以我猜是克里德亲了她。

1507
01:00:48.040 --> 01:00:50.400
And he says, have I ever steered you wrong, Jim?
他说，吉姆，我什么时候骗过你？

1508
01:00:50.660 --> 01:00:50.900
Yeah.
是啊。

1509
01:00:51.000 --> 01:00:52.060
Just go in and kiss her.
直接进去亲她就行。

1510
01:00:52.220 --> 01:00:53.040
Just do it.
直接上吧。

1511
01:00:53.160 --> 01:00:56.100
That just, you know, that's what you should do.
那只是，你知道的，那是你应该做的。

1512
01:00:56.100 --> 01:01:02.020
When he called Andy, Jim, if you're Andy, wouldn't you think, hmm, there's many reasons
当他给安迪打电话时，吉姆，如果你是安迪，难道不会想，嗯，有很多理由

1513
01:01:02.020 --> 01:01:02.960
to her red flags.
去注意她的危险信号吗？

1514
01:01:03.340 --> 01:01:04.380
There's so many red flags.
有太多的危险信号了。

1515
01:01:04.420 --> 01:01:05.320
So many red flags.
太多的危险信号。

1516
01:01:05.480 --> 01:01:09.260
Well, for whatever reason, Andy is going to take Creed's advice.
好吧，不管出于什么原因，安迪还是打算听从克里德的建议。

1517
01:01:09.260 --> 01:01:10.900
He's going to walk Julia to the car.
他要送朱莉娅去车边。

1518
01:01:11.060 --> 01:01:11.960
He forgot his coat.
他忘了拿外套。

1519
01:01:12.120 --> 01:01:13.840
Could he run back in and get it real quick?
他能跑回去快速拿一下吗？

1520
01:01:14.300 --> 01:01:15.800
Because he's very, very cold.
因为他非常非常冷。

1521
01:01:16.120 --> 01:01:18.420
Julia says, my car's right here, I think.
朱莉娅说，我想我的车就在这儿。

1522
01:01:18.860 --> 01:01:20.860
Thanks for walking me down, but I'm good.
谢谢你送我出来，但我自己可以。

1523
01:01:20.860 --> 01:01:24.820
And then when he gets her to the car, he goes in for a kiss.
然后当他把她送到车边时，他凑过去想亲她。

1524
01:01:25.380 --> 01:01:27.300
Andy, come on.
安迪，拜托。

1525
01:01:27.500 --> 01:01:29.820
This woman has had to put up with so much in this meeting.
这个女人在这次会议上已经忍受了太多了。

1526
01:01:30.020 --> 01:01:31.100
And now this?
现在又来这一出？

1527
01:01:31.840 --> 01:01:33.980
Also, like, she could write him up.
而且，她完全可以举报他。

1528
01:01:34.440 --> 01:01:35.200
I know.
我知道。

1529
01:01:35.440 --> 01:01:37.060
He could lose his job, Andy.
安迪，他可能会丢掉工作的。

1530
01:01:37.440 --> 01:01:39.420
Don't listen to Creed, Andy.
别听克里德的，安迪。

1531
01:01:39.660 --> 01:01:41.240
They do lose the account.
他们确实丢掉了那个客户。

1532
01:01:41.440 --> 01:01:41.760
Yeah.
是啊。

1533
01:01:41.760 --> 01:01:42.920
He has a talking head.
他有个采访镜头。

1534
01:01:43.180 --> 01:01:45.360
So he kind of lost in every way today.
所以他今天算是全盘皆输。

1535
01:01:45.640 --> 01:01:47.520
He lost three accounts.
他丢了三个客户。

1536
01:01:47.800 --> 01:01:49.660
He lost two that he gave to Stanley.
他丢了两个他交给斯坦利的客户。

1537
01:01:49.840 --> 01:01:50.160
Oh, yeah.
哦，没错。

1538
01:01:50.160 --> 01:01:53.400
The one that Stanley gave to him, Andy kind of showed his ass.
斯坦利交给他的那个，安迪算是丢人现眼了。

1539
01:01:53.600 --> 01:01:53.880
Yeah.
是啊。

1540
01:01:54.140 --> 01:01:54.360
Yeah.
没错。

1541
01:01:54.540 --> 01:01:55.020
He did.
确实。

1542
01:01:55.660 --> 01:02:02.580
Well, speaking of showing your ass, Karen has asked Michael to leave the conference room and come to her office.
说到丢人现眼，凯伦让迈克尔离开会议室去她的办公室。

1543
01:02:02.780 --> 01:02:04.640
It's like getting called to the principal's office.
就像被叫去校长办公室一样。

1544
